<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $11 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $11 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Wednesday it placed $11 million in overnight reverse repos at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>Call money was flat at 5.7 percent from the close Tuesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was unchanged at 0.99984 pesos from Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
